    806  f100							; (2026-10-15) GRP0 blank REMOVED: +5c pushed the rows0/1 setup
    807  f100							; segment to 75c armed (>=74 = write lands next line = +1 stall line
    808  f100							; = whole-screen shift). The blank only traded a stale-byte duplicate
    809  f100							; for a blank line at band boundaries — shipped pre-99b8e86 without
    810  f100							; either; case15 filters zero writes so the Y-align guard is unaffected.
    811  f100							; --- Scanlines this pass: rows 0/1 = 48; row 2 = 36+off (tide, CollisionX).
    812  f100							; The bottom water strip (last 12-off lines, bottom_band_plan rule 2)
    813  f100							; renders in .WaterRow after this pass — its own setup line + (11-off)
    814  f100							; bodies keeps the row-2 total at 49 lines (setup+48) exactly.
    815  f100							; Split tail (2026-10-05, row1 setup gap 77->74): row1 gate used to pay
    816  f100							; `bne` 3c to skip the tide load AND share the WSYNC — gap was 77 (stall,
    817  f100							; +1 line/frame). Rows 0/1 now store+WSYNC before the tide block, then
    818  f100							; jmp over it (+3c charged to the FIRST body line = 66max+3jmp+3WSYNC
    819  f100							; = 72 <=76). Row2 path byte-identical in cost (cpx/beqT/lda/sta/WSYNC
    820  f100							; = 11+3 = 76, zero margin — the `beq` target is 9 bytes ahead, same
    821  f100							; page, T=3c; do not let this block grow toward a page edge).
    822  f100							; A1 gap fix (2026-10-05): `sta Temp` (+3c in .Row) pushed gaps to
    823  f100							; 77/79 = stall EVERY frame (265-line frames). `sta LineCount` moved
    824  f100							; AFTER `sta WSYNC` — same bytes, -3c from the gap window, +3c to the
    825  f100							; first body line (66max+3LC[+3jmp]+3WSYNC = 75 rows0/1, 72 row2).
    826  f100							; LineCount is not read until the line's `dec` tail — the early store
    827  f100							; was never required; keep the store strictly between WSYNC and .Line.
    828  f100		       e0 02		      cpx	#TILE_ROWS-1
    829  f102		       f0 09		      beq	.RowLinesTide	; row 2: tide count (36+off) from CollisionX
    830  f104							; rows 0/1: fixed 48 lines (the vcrunch shutter slice derive is gone).
    831  f104		       a9 30		      lda	#48
