   1115  f1fb							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1116  f1fb							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1117  f1fb							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1118  f1fb							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1119  f1fb							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
