   1796  f507							; SelectActiveObject restored to bank0 (A1, 2026-10-20 — reverts C1). The
   1797  f507							; body + the two type tables sit in the $F615 fill (before CallPad_RaftBody's
   1798  f507							; $F8C0 pin) so nothing ahead of them moves address: bank0's flow tail is not
   1799  f507							; binding any more (680 B of org-able fill), and the move frees ~360 B in
   1800  f507							; bank2 for the bank3 evacuation. Entry is a plain in-bank `jsr` from the VBL;
   1801  f507							; the type byte comes through FoldIndirect and the dark test through
   1802  f507							; CallPad_IsRoomDark again (they are bank2/bank1 boundaries, not re-implemented
   1803  f507							; here). Guards: verify_build pins the bank0 SetObjectXPos page contract;
