   2604  f901							; ==============================================================================
   2605  f901							; YToRowTable — convert scanline to 48-line band row (0-2), idx A>>2
   2606  f901							; ==============================================================================
   2607  f901							; The jsr wrapper that used to live here was dead (PlayerHitsMap inlines the
   2608  f901							; lsr/lsr/tay/lda lookup — saves 2 JSR stack push levels to keep SP >= $F8)
   2609  f901							; and was removed in S1.6. Table rationale: the old subtract loop grew
   2610  f901							; linearly with RoomY and made 3× PlayerHitsMap (fall 2 + L/R 1) exceed
   2611  f901							; overscan TIM64T=35 (~2240c) in 4-rect rooms → frame >262 lines → vertical
   2612  f901							; roll when strafing while falling.
   2613  f901							; Indexed by A>>2: 37 entries (idx 0-35 = A 0-143 = the player envelope
   2614  f901							; "Max A = PLAYER_MAX_Y+11 = 143", + idx36 = the tentacle-bob clamp, below).
   2615  f901							; Costs +4c/call vs the 192-entry table, saves 144 ROM bytes.
   2616  f901							; Row = idx/12 = scanline/48 (3 cave bands of 48 lines = rows 0-2).
   2617  f901							;
   2618  f901							; 36 entries: 12 each of 0,1,2 (value = index/12 = scanline/48) +
   2619  f901							; idx36 = 2: tentacle RoomY 133/134 (bob on spawn y=132) → A=(Y+11)>>2 =
   2620  f901							; 36 — WITHOUT this byte the lookup reads the OOB opcode ($A5 = `lda
   2621  f901							; RoomY`) → CollisionEndY garbage → cell walk false-hits ~24/32 bob
   2622  f901							; frames → measured 0.125 px/f vs the &1 gate's 0.5 (bugs.md #13).
