   3714  fda3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3715  fda3							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3716  fda3							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3717  fda3							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3718  fda3							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3719  fda3							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3720  fda3							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3721  fda3							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3722  fda3							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3723  fda3							;   in S3.0b.
