   3749  fdcb							; is fetched from bank2's byte-identical mirror at this same address and
   3750  fdcb							; lands on the body at $FD87 (the lamp type-check reads enemy records that
   3751  fdcb							; live in bank2). Body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8); A = 1 kill (BombTick
   3752  fdcb							; awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none. Old inline body ($F87F, 66B)
   3753  fdcb							; deleted: the region re-packs into the gap before the $FBD6 fold pin
   3754  fdcb							; (pre-pad headroom stays 1B — pins absorb upstream shrink, not the org).
