   3828  fe90							; ObjColorTab — per-scanline GRP1 object colors, stride 8 = ObjSprites
   3829  fe90							; stride; indexed by the same X = ObjBase + r in .Grp1 at $FE00 (4c, same
   3830  fe90							; page for all 72 B — the passing +7 probe's exact cycle sum). Row colors
   3831  fe90							; per OBJ_* slot: type color x8 (matches EnemyColorTable /
   3832  fe90							; SelectActiveObject frame colors — no visual change for enemies/lamp/bomb);
   3833  fe90							; MINER slot = miner.png purple/pink/grey -> nearest NTSC $54/$4A/$08.
   3834  fe90							; NOTE: dark rooms no longer force grey objects — the frame-level $0A write
