   3838  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3839  fe90							; FoldIndirect — cross-bank data fetch (HERO fold, write-triggered;
   3840  fe90							; level_bank_plan §0.1). Pad lands $FEF6-$FEFF (last byte ≤ $FEFF — $FF00
   3841  fe90							; stays the fineAdjust anchor). Bytes must be byte-identical in bank2
   3842  fe90							; (guard: verify_build) — after `sta $1FF8` the CPU fetches the remainder
   3843  fe90							; from the data bank at the same PC.
   3844  fe90							; Contract: bank select is ABSOLUTE $1FF8 (bank2) — X/Y both preserved,
   3845  fe90							; A = junk in, data out (`sta $1FF6` switches back, A preserved).
   3846  fe90							; P3.1 deviation (plan §0): `sta $1FF8,X` required X=0, but every enemy
   3847  fe90							; loop keeps the slot in X and has no free temp to swap (DEY/snake hold
   3848  fe90							; Temp live across the read). All level data is bank2, so X-selection is
   3849  fe90							; dead weight; bank3 data later needs a second entry `sta $1FF9` pad.
   3850  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3851  fe90							; E4 moth entry tramp ($FEF0-$FEF5) — byte-identical with bank2's copy
   3852  fe90							; (guard: verify_build check_moth_tramp). bank0 executes `sta $1FF8`; the next
   3853  fe90							; fetch ($FEF3) comes from bank2 = `jmp MothRoutine`. Neither bank runs its
   3854  fe90							; other half: bank0 is switched away at $FEF2, bank2 is never entered here.
   3855  fe90							; The 6-byte pad is the only free hole before FoldIndirect's pinned $FEF6.
   3856  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3857  fe90		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	$FE96 - *, 0	; S5.4 LHT entry tramp (byte-identical w/ bank2,
   3858  fe96							; guard: check_moth_tramp — shifted +$10)
   3859  fe96				   LaserHitTest
   3860  fe96		       8d f8 1f 	      sta	$1FF8	; select bank2
   3861  fe99		       4c 00 ff 	      jmp	$FF00	; bank2 LaserHitTestBody (dead in bank0; guard
   3862  fe9c							;   pins operands == bank2.lst label)
